gate: experience.detect
skip_when: the reviewed changes carry no detection signal, a cpat or task-type document already records the pattern, or the durable-context selection of this invocation already listed or omitted it
budget: 0
taxonomy: none
produces: none
next: experience.offer

gate: experience.offer
skip_when: the invocation's question budget is exhausted per skills/_shared/elicitation-contract.md
budget: 1
taxonomy: none
produces: cpat, task-type, or guide, per the accepted answer draft
next: end

